<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Health Management cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Health Management cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Health Management Associates Inc to intermediate-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- said keep Health Management as a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Health Management lost 1-1/2 to 28-7/8.</p>
</text>
